# The Appfile is a configuration file for fastlane. It's usually placed in the root of the project.
# It contains metadata about your app that can be used by fastlane.
# If you want to get a list of all available options run `fastlane docs`

# In general, you won't have to change anything in this file.
# Take a look at the `fastlane/` directory.
# There, you'll find the Fastfile, which is the main file you can modify.

app_identifier("com.codegas") # The bundle identifier of your app
apple_id("your-apple-id@example.com") # Your Apple email address

itc_team_id("123456789") # App Store Connect Team ID
team_id("ABCD123456") # Apple Developer Portal Team ID

# For more information about the Appfile, see:
